WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.173 --> 00:00:01.810
- Maybe toss an egg in there for protein.

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:02.874
- Maybe, that actually
would be pretty good.

00:00:02.874 --> 00:00:03.756
- Maybe, we don't know.

00:00:03.756 --> 00:00:05.282
- Okay, gettin' fancy on me.

00:00:05.282 --> 00:00:06.324
(laughing)

00:00:06.324 --> 00:00:07.530
- I'm a very fancy person.

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.363
- As am I.

00:00:08.363 --> 00:00:09.266
- So.

00:00:09.266 --> 00:00:11.148
(laughing)

00:00:11.148 --> 00:00:12.434
(light upbeat music)

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.722
- What's up guys, I'm Inga.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:16.548
I grew up in Hong Kong
and I love instant ramen.

00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:18.780
I know most people think
instant ramen's more like

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.646
a broke college student's
breakfast, lunch, and dinner.

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:24.724
But come on guys, there
are so many more amazing

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.797
instant ramen brands out
there that people need to try.

00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:31.095
So I went to Chinatown found a
couple of my favorite brands,

00:00:31.095 --> 00:00:32.506
brought them back to the office

00:00:32.506 --> 00:00:35.106
to show my coworkers a whole new world.

00:00:35.106 --> 00:00:36.869
(upbeat jazzy music)

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:39.952
(cash register bell)

00:00:48.155 --> 00:00:51.067
- This looks legit, and...

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:51.900
- It smells really good.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.978
- It smells legit.

00:00:52.978 --> 00:00:53.986
- Uh...

00:00:53.986 --> 00:00:55.330
- Yeah that's Shin smell.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:59.623
- It's reminiscent of
instant ramen but better.

00:00:59.623 --> 00:01:00.943
- It's a little spicier
than I was expecting.

00:01:00.943 --> 00:01:01.776
- Yeah. It's nice.

00:01:01.776 --> 00:01:02.712
- Which is a pleasant surprise.

00:01:02.712 --> 00:01:04.967
- Lot's of flavor. Salty. Spicy.

00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:05.800
- Spicy.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:07.036
- The broth really tastes like

00:01:07.036 --> 00:01:08.455
the broth you get at the restaurant

00:01:08.455 --> 00:01:10.776
when you go get fancy ramen.

00:01:10.776 --> 00:01:12.639
- I'm like probably gonna
finish this if that's okay.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:13.472
(laughter)

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:14.462
- Now I'm excited for the next one.

00:01:14.462 --> 00:01:15.295
- Yeah.

00:01:15.295 --> 00:01:18.378
(upbeat jazzy music)

00:01:21.946 --> 00:01:22.779
- Ooh!

00:01:22.779 --> 00:01:23.624
- Whoa!

00:01:23.624 --> 00:01:24.457
- This is nice!

00:01:24.457 --> 00:01:25.290
- The oil on this!

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.123
- Yeah!

00:01:26.123 --> 00:01:27.278
- It looks fancier than
the one that we just had.

00:01:27.278 --> 00:01:29.182
- It smells almost like, creamier maybe.

00:01:29.182 --> 00:01:30.894
- Is it Uni? Truffle?

00:01:30.894 --> 00:01:31.727
- Powdered milk?

00:01:31.727 --> 00:01:33.440
- I'm trying so hard to place it.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.846
- I feel like there's coconut in this.

00:01:34.846 --> 00:01:37.910
- Definitely something
from the ocean is in here.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.576
- It's the perfect amount of like salty...

00:01:40.576 --> 00:01:41.566
- Yeah.

00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:43.078
- Spicy, and creamy.

00:01:43.078 --> 00:01:45.295
- I like milk but only
in coffee or cereal.

00:01:45.295 --> 00:01:47.910
Not necessarily when it's
mixed in with other stuff.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.582
- I'm surprised this is instant.

00:01:49.582 --> 00:01:51.544
- This is my new favorite.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:54.627
(upbeat jazzy music)

00:01:59.473 --> 00:02:01.409
- This one looks like artisanal.

00:02:01.409 --> 00:02:03.898
- This smells incredible.

00:02:03.898 --> 00:02:05.362
- It smells expensive.

00:02:05.362 --> 00:02:06.195
(cash register bell)

00:02:06.195 --> 00:02:07.558
- It is so beautiful.

00:02:07.558 --> 00:02:08.391
- No broth.

00:02:08.391 --> 00:02:09.518
- Yeah no broth.

00:02:09.518 --> 00:02:11.532
- I've never had mayo on noodles before.

00:02:11.532 --> 00:02:12.365
- Oh! Yum!

00:02:13.223 --> 00:02:14.223
- It's good.

00:02:17.293 --> 00:02:18.918
- The flavors are really crazy,

00:02:18.918 --> 00:02:21.437
and they're like kind of
baked into the noodles.

00:02:21.437 --> 00:02:22.597
- The mayo's so interesting.

00:02:22.597 --> 00:02:23.949
I don't know if I would've picked it,

00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:25.581
but now I'm eating it I'm like into it.

00:02:25.581 --> 00:02:28.141
- I would never have assumed
it came from a dried form.

00:02:28.141 --> 00:02:31.465
- I'm like super into this.
This tastes really good to me.

00:02:31.465 --> 00:02:33.257
- This is very delicious.

00:02:33.257 --> 00:02:34.169
- It's pretty restaurant quality.

00:02:34.169 --> 00:02:36.075
- This actually tastes
like restaurant quality.

00:02:36.075 --> 00:02:37.859
- If it's like a rainy
day and I'm in my P.J.'s.

00:02:37.859 --> 00:02:39.129
Like, I would snack on this.

00:02:39.129 --> 00:02:39.962
- Yeah.

00:02:39.962 --> 00:02:40.795
- Clearly.

00:02:40.795 --> 00:02:42.897
(bowls clattering)

00:02:42.897 --> 00:02:43.969
- Yeah. Totally good.

00:02:43.969 --> 00:02:45.081
- Yeah. Really clean.

00:02:45.081 --> 00:02:46.706
(upbeat techno music)

00:02:46.706 --> 00:02:48.393
- I thought I knew all
kinds of instant ramen,

00:02:48.393 --> 00:02:49.947
but today my mind was blown

00:02:49.947 --> 00:02:51.546
because there were some different flavors.

00:02:51.546 --> 00:02:53.105
- Not only is like, the
quality can be better,

00:02:53.105 --> 00:02:55.002
but also like there's
so much different types

00:02:55.002 --> 00:02:57.513
and interpretations. It's pretty cool.

00:02:57.513 --> 00:02:59.193
- They really defied my expectations

00:02:59.193 --> 00:03:02.822
in terms of what the
gourmet landscape was like.

00:03:02.822 --> 00:03:04.910
- I've seen the other
side. I cannot go back.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.478
- I feel like we went on a journey.

00:03:06.478 --> 00:03:07.510
- Yeah. We traveled.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:08.534
- You're a changed man.

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:09.367
- Yeah.

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:10.200
(laughing)

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.358
Today changed me.

00:03:11.358 --> 00:03:13.662
- That flavor and the water as well.

00:03:13.662 --> 00:03:15.246
I mean, the broth, as well. Sorry.

00:03:15.246 --> 00:03:16.446
For calling it water.

00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:19.696
(upbeat techno music)

